<!--
  Static sitemap of the public, stable pages.

  Deliberately excludes tutor profiles and search result URLs. Profiles come
  and go as people pause or close accounts, and a sitemap listing URLs that
  404 is worse than a smaller accurate one. If profile indexing is wanted
  later it should be generated from the database at build or request time, not
  maintained by hand here.
-->
